{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"\n\nHere are the two bugs I've identified in `services/transactions/workflow.py`:\n\n1. **Duplicate notification on retry**: `queue.emit` is called twice (`payment_failed` emitted on both lines 13–14).\n2. **Missing ledger refund on cancellation**: When billing fails, the order is cancelled but no refund is recorded in the ledger, breaking atomicity.\n\nLet me fix both issues and update the docs.\n\n"}}
